Third-party data

The files in data/wine-quality/ are derived from the "Wine Quality" dataset by
P. Cortez, A. Cerdeira, F. Almeida, T. Matos and J. Reis (UCI Machine Learning
Repository, https://doi.org/10.24432/C56S3T). They are NOT covered by the MIT
License above: they are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International (CC BY 4.0) license, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.
modified.csv and the files in data/wine-quality/official/ are modified versions
(deliberately corrupted, then cleaned) prepared for this workshop.
